{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vual59lxf11795433534.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>尖沙咀寶勒巷周日發生致命車禍，有私家車剷上行人路，造成一死三傷。香港巴基斯坦協會指，死者是協會執行委員會成員，亦是知名商人。</p><p></p><p>53歲南亞裔傷者頭部重傷，昏迷送院搶救後不治。香港巴基斯坦協會在社交平台發文指，死者是協會的執行委員會成員，亦是一名知名商人，在巴基斯坦裔社群中深受愛戴，又形容他為人仁厚，擁有堪稱典範的品格，服務巴基斯坦協會逾十年。亦曾擔任本港一個伊斯蘭教議會的副主席。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR.FOLO-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jMozO5kpjT1795433701.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>周日下午約2時半，一輛私家車剷上寶勒巷行人路，司機懷疑棄車逃去，警方之後以酒後駕駛及危險駕駛引致他人死亡，拘捕男司機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.661215+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:57:19.296035+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:13.405613+00:00","content_hash":"97738d211638d4919e200b3e780207b2b9452b562087282bd7da3ba0023b26dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.661215+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}